## Hard Disqualifiers (Auto-Skip)

Don't waste a connect on these regardless of score:

- Posts asking for "the cheapest" provider, or budget < $500 on a build
- "Quick task" / "few hours" hourly listings with no scope of growth
- Clients with no payment verified, no hire history, or low (< 50%) hire rate after many posts
- Industries that are flatly outside ICP (legal services, local trades, generic agencies)
- Posts that read as resold work for an agency middleman
- VAs / "email assistant" / mailbox-management roles
- Job descriptions that show no understanding of lifecycle marketing — these turn into education projects, not paid ones

