## Upwork Search Filters

Pre-filter the feed so only viable opportunities reach the scoring step.

**Saved search filters to set up:**

- **Category:** Marketing → Email Marketing, Marketing Automation, Marketing Strategy
- **Job type:** Fixed-price preferred; Hourly only if rate ≥ $75
- **Budget:** $1,000+ on fixed-price; ignore anything under
- **Project length:** 1–3 months (the 30–45 day sweet spot)
- **Experience level:** Expert
- **Client history:** Payment verified ✅, $10K+ total spend, hire rate ≥ 60%
- **Client location:** US, UK, CA, AU (filters out a lot of low-budget noise)
- ** Client: small business 1-9 Empoloyees, Medium Business 10-99 employees, Large Business/Enterprise

**Keyword searches to run daily:**

- "Klaviyo" build / migration / audit / flows / strategy
- "lifecycle marketing" or "lifecycle email"
- "marketing automation" + (Shopify OR DTC OR e-commerce)
- "ActiveCampaign" build / setup / strategy
- "email strategy" / "email program" / "email audit"
- "fractional" + (CRM OR lifecycle OR email)

**Negative keywords to mute:**

- "VA", "assistant", "send my emails", "manage inbox"
- "graphic designer needed", "Mailchimp template only"
- "newsletter" alone (often hobbyist)
- "$5/hr", "$10/hr", "small budget"

